---
import { contacts } from '../data/site';
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer data-testid="footer" class="bg-[#0A0A0A] text-white py-16 lg:py-20">
	<div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 sm:px-8">
		<div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 mb-12">
			<div>
				<div class="font-display text-xl font-bold tracking-tight">CreateMind</div>
				<p class="mt-4 text-sm text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed max-w-md">
					Команда разработчиков, которая внедряет искусственный интеллект в реальные бизнес-процессы.
				</p>
			</div>
			<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 lg:justify-end">
				<a
					href={contacts.telegram}
					target="_blank"
					rel="noopener noreferrer"
					class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-zinc-700 px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-zinc-300 hover:text-white hover:border-zinc-500 transition-colors"
				>
					Telegram
				</a>
				<a
					href={contacts.whatsapp}
					target="_blank"
					rel="noopener noreferrer"
					class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-zinc-700 px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-zinc-300 hover:text-white hover:border-zinc-500 transition-colors"
				>
					WhatsApp
				</a>
				<a
					href={`mailto:${contacts.email}`}
					class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-zinc-700 px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-zinc-300 hover:text-white hover:border-zinc-500 transition-colors"
				>
					{contacts.email}
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="border-t border-zinc-800 pt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between gap-4 text-xs text-zinc-500">
			<p>CreateMind © {year} CreateMind. Все права защищены.</p>
			<p>AI-автоматизация для бизнеса</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</footer>
